        {
          "text": "Muvogono vwukutumikira ivifunyaa mwayu, valafunya vugundu, mu vogono vwu kwevoha misibi mirahi, valevoha zimbunu, havogono hi liisu lilahi, valava ni chole, na havogono hi zinguvu zindahi, valivika zinguvu zia madali. Ligondo liavo lilahi lilagirunganywa kuva zisoni.",
          "type": "text",
